{% comment %}
  Trophy Mart — Product Catalog slider (based on src/components/ProductCatalog.tsx).

  Self-contained. Upload ONLY sections/product-catalog.liquid.

  Pick a collection in the section settings; its products render as clean
  portrait (3:4) product-image cards with the product name below, linking to
  the product page. While no collection is picked, the store's default
  all-products list is used. Arrows scroll; the track auto-advances every
  3.5s, pausing on hover/touch and when off-screen.
{% endcomment %}

